CryptDisk 1.2.1 full version. Fat binary.
-----------------------------------------
This is a repacked archive! No changes have been made to the application!
The original archive which was around was truncated (BinHex files SHOULD
end in a : ). Only the "CryptDisk Documentation"-file was affected and
this has been replaced by the same file from the 1.2.1D distribution.
Note that this is an archive which should not be out of the US but that
I didn't export it. I just re-packed the archive I found in Europe.

Groet,
M10
